1304 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /Figure
  /P 1303 0 R
  /Alt (A hierarchical diagram illustrating the structure of the High Resolution Layer (HRL) Small Linear Features (SLF) 2021 product suite. The suite is composed of four main categories: Status Layer, Change Layer, Auxiliary Layers, and Reference Data. The **Status Layer** comprises: * Woody Vegetation Layer 5m * Small Woody Features 5m (raster) * Small Woody Features Vector * Street Tree Layer Vector * Small Woody Features (SWF) Density 100m (raster) The **Change Layer** includes: * Small Woody Features (SWF) Change The **Auxiliary Layers** consist of: * Parent Scene Identification Layer (PSIL) * Woody Vegetation Layer (WVL) Confidence Layer * Forest Mask 2021 * Crop Mask 2021 * Street Tree Layer (STL) Urban Mask 2021 The **Reference Data** category contains: * Training Data * Validation Data)
  /A [<<
    /O /Layout
    /Placement /Block
  >>]
  /K [11]
  /Pg 1998 0 R
>>
endobj

